# Decisions

Write an ADR when all three hold:

1. Hard to reverse — changing your mind later costs real effort
2. Surprising without context — a later reader will ask why
3. A real trade-off — genuine alternatives, a reason for this one

Skip the ADR if any one of the three is missing.

Path: `docs/adr/NNNN-slug.md` (next unused number). Title plus 1–3 sentences: context, choice, why. Format: [`ADR-FORMAT.md`](../../.agents/skills/domain-modeling/ADR-FORMAT.md).
